                  <ul>
                    <li>
                      <b>{"LA-X01"}</b>
                      {" sets the due time from the service, the pickup time, the cut-off (Regular / Same-day 10:00, Express 14:00) and Sunday / holiday rules; orders received after the cut-off move to the next cycle."}
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <b>{"BR-02"}</b>
                      {" the laundry count is billed; a difference with the guest list is recorded (LA-P02) and the guest informed before delivery."}
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <b>{"BR-03"}</b>
                      {" rates come from the price list PV-2026-01 (LAS-03); Express +50 %, Same-day +25 %; manual price changes need permission."}
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <b>{"LA-X02"}</b>
                      {" on delivery the charge posts to the folio window with SAC 999711 and GST 18 % (FD-X02); the posting reference is written on the order."}
                    </li>
                    <li>{"Every status change, count, price change and posting is in the audit log (BR-10)."}</li>
                  </ul>
